  title: "The Emergency, 1975\u201377"
  text: On 25 June 1975 a national Emergency was declared, citing internal disturbance. Civil liberties were suspended, opposition leaders jailed and the press censored. It ended in 1977, and the Janata Party won the elections that followed.
